 "summary": "The Z-4RTD2-SI reads four RTD sensors (PT100, PT500, PT1000, NI100, NI120, NI1000, CU50, CU100) in 2, 3 or 4-wire mode and serves them over Modbus RTU. Each channel is available as a scaled 16-bit integer and as a float. This map covers measurements, error flags, serial settings, per-channel configuration, fault values, offsets and the command register.",
